WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.220
 Thank you. Well now it's time for our last inductee and as they all say it's

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:09.000
 last but certainly not least.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
 Many people asked us if they could be the one to induct Dr. Mohan Bafna.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.220
 But we thought that with his stature as patriarch of this great family, it

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:27.000
 would be fitting for his son, Shiresh, to induct his father.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.880
 Shiresh received his BS/MEA Operations Management from Weatherbit School of

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:42.000
 Management at Case Western Reserve University.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.140
 He is the owner of Janko Tech, Raptite and Solon which provides complete

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:51.000
 imaging services for professional photographers

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.950
 and is an importer distributor of packaging films, envelopes and supplies for

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:59.000
 the shipping industry.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.000
 Where are you Shiresh?

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.000
 Come on.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.100
 I know there's a person who's not represented and probably wouldn't mind

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.000
 talking to you.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:21.000
 Alright Shiresh if you could introduce any of your father into the hall.

